'''Update: 15:30 GMT, March 22nd''': We've temporarily made a hotfix that disables the automatic purging of permanently banned or muted accounts from players' ignore list. We'll re-activate this feature in the near future, but need extra time to correct some bugs with the feature that arose after launch. Apologies for the inconvenience, we'll let you know when the auto-purge is back and working as-intended!

Attention speedy ‘Scapers: the final batch of Quest Speedrunning updates is here!

This week's update is smaller than most, so we wanted to take a moment to let you know that the team are working away behind the scenes. Next week you'll be able to get your hands on some upcoming Bounty Hunter rewards in beta worlds. When the Bounty Hunter rewards beta wraps up, you'll get the chance to experiment with some Desert Treasure II - The Fallen Empire rewards in another beta. If you're not feeling beta (sorry...) after reading that, perhaps the promise of three New Skill pitches in the very near future is something to look forward to!

With all that said, let's take a look at exactly what's changing in Gielinor this week.

==Changelog - March 22nd==
