'''Quest Speedrunning - Final Batch'''
* Black Knights' Fortress and Dragon Slayer II have been fully added to Quest Speedrunning Worlds.
* A Diamond time has been added to all quests in Quest Speedrunning. This doesn't give points but instead awards you a Diamond Trophy item for your main save. This is only equippable if you've completed the Diamond time for every available quest.

'''Other Changes'''
* Party leaders in Tombs of Amascut can now promote other members of the party while the group is forming in the lobby.
