==Quest Speedrunning Final Batch==
Dragon Slayer II and Black Knights' Fortress are now out of Beta and ready for you on Quest Speedrunning Worlds!

That will be the last of our [https://secure.runescape.com/m=news/quest-speedrunning-blog?oldschool=1 promised Quest Speedrunning updates], but don’t worry, we'll still be adding more in the future, just at less regular intervals.

Quest Speedrunning Worlds allow you to replay some of Old School's most iconic quests with the aim of completing them as quickly as possible. You're given stats and any items required for each quest and will earn points depending on how quickly you finish. As you might expect, faster times (such as Platinum or Diamond times) reward more points, which can be exchanged for main-game cosmetics such as the Adventurer's outfit or Speedy teleport Scroll - just visit Eliza in Varrock Square to claim your fast fashionscape!

If you're looking for some handy resources to help get you started, we'd recommend checking out the [[Quest Speedrunning|OSRS Wiki page]] (where you can even find speedrun guides for each of the quests) or [https://discord.gg/m3AaNEWJax the Quest Speedrunning Discord].

