As an extra twist, we've added Diamond Times to all the current quests available on QSR Worlds. These don't offer any additional points but achieving all of the Diamond times on every available quest will snag you an exclusive Diamond Trophy for your main account.

[[File:Quest Speedrunning's Final Batch (1).png|thumb|centre|400px|''A hefty prize for the fastest runners among you. It looks pretty heavy - hopefully you've been working on those arms alongside your speedrun cardio!'']]


This item can be equipped, so you can really flex how fast of a spacebar speedster you truly are. In the manner of Quest Cape, Music Cape and other similar items, when new content is released you'll need to achieve any new Diamond Times in order to equip the item. Good luck!

Finally, we've introduced some techniques to prevent players getting a headstart on speedruns by performing actions before the quest begins. Namely, ashes and hunter traps can no longer be obtained by lighting a fire or placing a hunter trap before starting your run - meaning you'll have to route them into your run instead!

